00:00:47,220 --> 00:00:48,860
When this course first started,

19
00:00:48,860 --> 00:00:51,090
So, we had everyone do this little... uh... experiment.

20
00:00:51,090 --> 00:00:53,190
A lot of people finished it in just 10 or 20 minutes.

21
00:00:53,190 --> 00:00:55,440
Alright, so here's what it generated all in one go.

22
00:00:55,440 --> 00:00:56,520
generated from just a single prompt.

23
00:00:56,520 --> 00:00:57,800
So when you go to add a new product,

24
00:00:57,800 --> 00:00:59,500
It has the product code and name,

25
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:03,180
barcode, category, brand, base unit, specification, and model number.

26
00:01:03,180 --> 00:01:04,420
So, let's click 'Save'.

27
00:01:04,420 --> 00:01:07,140
See? It doesn't give you any corresponding prompts.

28
00:01:07,140 --> 00:01:08,240
Nothing at all.

29
