But when we're actually in a production environment,

30
00:01:11,300 --> 00:01:12,420
we click 'save'...

31
00:01:12,420 --> 00:01:14,680
It's supposed to tell you which fields can't be empty.

32
00:01:14,680 --> 00:01:17,400
All these little details, like what's required here, what's required there... you need to specify all of it.

33
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:20,340
And then, should this be called an SKU or a Product Code?

34
00:01:20,340 --> 00:01:23,420
And then, for this one, does it have to be 'Product Name' or can it just be 'Name'?

35
00:01:23,420 --> 00:01:24,780
And then, what about this? Is it called 'Product Category'?

36
00:01:24,780 --> 00:01:26,180
or a level-four category, or what have you.

37
00:01:26,180 --> 00:01:27,880
Level-3 category, and so on and so forth.

38
00:01:27,880 --> 00:01:29,320
You have to define all of these things.

39
00:01:29,320 --> 00:01:31,680
So, what do you absolutely need?

40
00:01:31,680 --> 00:01:35,080
You absolutely need to define this list of fields properly.

41
00:01:35,080 --> 00:01:37,919
I mean, what are we going to call this field?

42
00:01:37,919 --> 00:01:39,799
And then, how is its value determined?

43
00:01:39,799 --> 00:01:41,119
Where does its value come from?

44
00:01:41,119 --> 00:01:42,579
Is it a required field or not?

45
00:01:42,579 --> 00:01:45,119
And what are the logical validations for this field?

46
00:01:45,119 --> 00:01:46,379
You have to spell all of that out.

47
00:01:46,379 --> 00:01:47,420
If you don't spell it out,

48
00:01:47,420 --> 00:01:49,980
Then this is all the AI can give you.

49
00:01:49,980 --> 00:01:51,340
It seems perfect at first glance.

50
