00:01:58,640 --> 00:02:01,090
And then, for my product, it needs to support image uploads.

55
00:02:01,090 --> 00:02:03,530
Things like, what header image, description, and all that.

56
00:02:03,530 --> 00:02:04,370
And that doesn't seem to be there either.

57
00:02:04,370 --> 00:02:09,880
So, all it does is spit out a prototype that looks pretty good on the surface.

58
00:02:09,880 --> 00:02:12,200
But it misses all the nitty-gritty details.

59
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:15,100
It didn't even check the, let's say, the code for you.

60
00:02:15,100 --> 00:02:16,500
Hahaha, right?

61
00:02:16,500 --> 00:02:18,460
I mean, you obviously can't have Chinese characters in a code field, right?

62
00:02:18,460 --> 00:02:21,860
or some random special characters for that matter.

63
00:02:21,860 --> 00:02:23,460
See? It didn't even set any limitations.

64
00:02:23,460 --> 00:02:25,460
So, this is a clear issue.

65
00:02:25,460 --> 00:02:28,040
So, what about when we do it ourselves?

66
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:29,620
See, this is what I'm typing in.

67
00:02:29,620 --> 00:02:30,340
And look, here's what it says.

68
00:02:30,340 --> 00:02:32,880
For example, write something like, 'The product code must only contain uppercase letters.'

69
00:02:32,880 --> 00:02:33,460
So why is that?

70
00:02:33,460 --> 00:02:35,040
Because I fed it my constraints.

71
00:02:35,040 --> 00:02:36,880
