74
00:02:40,200 --> 00:02:41,680
So, it all comes back to the same point.

75
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:43,960
or about some magic 'web coding'

76
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:47,700
or that you can build a whole project with just a single sentence, and stuff like that.

